Context :  (born 26 December 1966) is Japanese manga artist from Sakata, Yamagata Prefecture. Two of his works, "Bambi and Her Pink Gun" and "Soil", have been published in French. "Bambi and Her Pink Gun" has been published in English, with "Search and Destroy" scheduled for English publication in May 2024. "Soil" has been adapted into a television drama series. References. &lt;templatestyles src="Reflist/styles.css" /&gt;

