Question : In what city was Florence Marie Harsant born?

Context : Florence Marie Harsant (née Woodhead; 19 September 1891 – 19 June 1994) was a New Zealand temperance worker, nurse, community leader and writer. Biography. She was born in New Plymouth, New Zealand, on 19 September 1891. In the 1981 Queen's Birthday Honours, Harsant was awarded the Queen's Service Medal for community service. She died on 19 June 1994, aged 102. References. &lt;templatestyles src="Reflist/styles.css" /&gt;

