Context : Executioner's Song is the debut studio album by Canadian speed/thrash metal band Razor, released in 1985. The majority of the tracks were originally in pre-production in December 1984 and were released as a demo tape titled "Escape the Fire". References. &lt;templatestyles src="Reflist/styles.css" /&gt;

