Context : Normal Life is an American sitcom television series that aired from March 21 until July 18, 1990. Premise. This series was based on the real unconventional home life of the Zappa children and their rocker dad Frank Zappa. References. &lt;templatestyles src="Reflist/styles.css" /&gt;

